  "content": "[Intro]\n[Ebmadd13]\n[Bmaj7/Eb]\n[Ebmadd13]\n[Bsus2/D]\n[Ebmadd13]\n[Bmaj7/Eb]\n[Ebmadd13]\n[Bsus2/D]  [Dm/F]\n[F#madd13]\n[Dmaj7/F#]\n[F#madd13]\n[Ddim/F]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Ebmadd13]Autumn has\n[Bmaj7/Eb]come to\n[Ebmadd13]rest In her\n[Bsus2/D]garden.\n[Ebmadd13]Come to paint the trees with\n[Bmaj7/Eb]emptyness\n[Ebmadd13]And no\n[Dm/F][Bsus2/D]pardon.\n[F#madd13]So many things have\n[Dmaj7/F#]come undone\n[F#madd13]Like the leaves on the\n[Ddim/F]ground And\n[F#madd13]suddenly she be-\n[Dmaj7/F#]gins to cry\n[F#madd13]But she doesn't know\n[Ddim/F]why. [Edim/G]\n\n[Intrelude]\n[G#madd13]\n[Emaj7/G#]\n[G#madd13]\n[Edim/G]  [Gdim/Bb]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Bmadd13]Heavy are the words that\n[Gmaj7/B]fall through the air\n[Bmadd13]To burden her\n[F#/A#]shoulders.\n[Bmadd13]Caught up in the tree Her\n[Gmaj7/B]soliloguy,\n[Bmadd13]\"Don't leave me a-\n[Gdim/Bb]lone\"",
